              "shortDescription": { "text": "CVE-2021-3121: Panic due to improper input validation in github.com/gogo/protobuf" },
              "fullDescription": { "text": "Due to improper bounds checking, maliciously crafted input to generated Unmarshal methods can cause an out-of-bounds panic.", "markdown": "Due to improper bounds checking, maliciously crafted input to generated Unmarshal methods can cause an out-of-bounds panic." },
              "deprecatedIds": ["CVE-2021-3121", "GO-2021-0053", "GHSA-c3h9-896r-86jm"],
              "help": {
                "text": "**Your dependency is vulnerable to [CVE-2021-3121](https://osv.dev/CVE-2021-3121)**.\n\n### Affected Packages\n\n| Source | Package Name | Package Version |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| lockfile:/path/to/go.mod | github.com/gogo/protobuf | 1.3.1 |\n\n## Remediation\n\n### Fixed Versions\n\n| Vulnerability ID | Package Name | Fixed Version |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| GO-2021-0053 | github.com/gogo/protobuf | 1.3.2 |\n",
                "markdown": "**Your dependency is vulnerable to [CVE-2021-3121](https://osv.dev/CVE-2021-3121)**.\n\n### Affected Packages\n\n| Source | Package Name | Package Version |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| lockfile:/path/to/go.mod | github.com/gogo/protobuf | 1.3.1 |\n\n## Remediation\n\n### Fixed Versions\n\n| Vulnerability ID | Package Name | Fixed Version |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| GO-2021-0053 | github.com/gogo/protobuf | 1.3.2 |\n"
              }
            },
