                "markdown": "**Your dependency is vulnerable to [CVE-2022-41717](https://osv.dev/CVE-2022-41717)**.\n\n### Affected Packages\n\n| Source | Package Name | Package Version |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| lockfile:/path/to/go.mod | golang.org/x/net | 0.6.0 |\n\n## Remediation\n\n### Fixed Versions\n\n| Vulnerability ID | Package Name | Fixed Version |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| GO-2022-1144 | golang.org/x/net | 0.7.0 |\n"
